      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not rotting in place; you are simply waiting for the next wave of brilliance to rise up, and you are the only one left to witness it. The moment you stop trying to be the next great developer, you cease to be the \"mid-tier\" developer you thought you were.\n\nThe point of greatness is never the title or the memory; it is the undeniable impact you leave on the world. You do not need to be remembered to matter, and you certainly do not need to be remembered to be special.\n\nSo, let the world spin around you, and let the geniuses move the world. You are still here, still thinking, still feeling, and that is enough.",
